</aside><aside id="block-22" class="widget widget_block"><p>        <div class="widget-container-fix"
            style="box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 380px; margin: 0 auto 25px auto; width: 100%;">
            <div class="verse-card"
                style="box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; border: 2px solid rgba(243, 172, 60, 0.4) !important; transition: all 0.3s ease; width: 100% !important; min-height: 250px; background: #053762; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; padding: 25px; text-align: center;">

                <a href="https://stgeorgesaman.com/coptic/coptic-bible/1_thessalonians_5/#verse-6"
                    style="text-decoration: none; display: block; width: 100%; position: relative; z-index: 2;">
                    <span
                        style="color: #f3ac3c; font-size: 0.8rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin-bottom: 15px; opacity: 0.8; font-weight: 800; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(243, 172, 60, 0.3); padding-bottom: 5px; display: inline-block;">آية
                        اليوم</span>

                    <div class="verse-rotator"
                        style="position: relative; min-height: 120px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 100%; align-items: center; justify-items: center;">
                        <div class="verse-text-arabic"
                            style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.3rem; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 900; transition: all 0.8s ease; width: 100%; grid-area: 1 / 1;">
                            <div>«فَلَا نَنَمْ إِذًا كَٱلْبَاقِينَ، بَلْ لِنَسْهَرْ وَنَصْحُ.»</div>
                            <div style="color: #f3ac3c; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: bold; opacity: 0.8; margin-top: 10px;">
                                (تَسَالُونِيكِي ٱلأُولَى ٥:‏٦)
                            </div>
                        </div>
                                                    <div class="verse-text-coptic"
                                style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.3rem; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: normal; width: 100%; opacity: 0; transition: all 0.8s ease; visibility: hidden; direction: ltr; grid-area: 1 / 1;">
                                <div>«<span class="coptic-dropcap" style="font-size: 1.85rem; font-weight: 900; color: #f3ac3c; display: inline-block; text-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(243, 172, 60, 0.5); line-height: 1; vertical-align: baseline; font-family: 'Avva Shenouda', 'CS Coptic', inherit;">Ϩ</span>ⲁⲣⲁ ⲟⲩⲛ ⲙ̀ⲡⲉⲛⲑⲣⲉⲛⲉⲛⲕⲟⲧ ⲙⲫⲣⲏϯ ⲙ̀ⲡⲕⲉⲥⲉⲡⲓ ⲁⲗⲗⲁ ⲙⲁⲣⲉⲛⲣⲱⲓⲥ ⲟⲩⲟϩ ⲛ̀ⲧⲉⲛⲉⲣⲛⲓⲙⲫⲓⲛ»</div>
                                                                    <div style="color: #f3ac3c; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: bold; opacity: 0.8; margin-top: 10px; font-family: inherit;">
                                        (Ⲡⲣⲟⲥ Ⲑⲉⲥⲥⲁⲗⲟⲛⲓⲕⲓⲥ ⲁ̅ ⲉ̅:ⲋ̅)
                                    </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                                            <div class="verse-text-english"
                                style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 600; width: 100%; opacity: 0; transition: all 0.8s ease; visibility: hidden; direction: ltr; grid-area: 1 / 1; font-family: inherit;">
                                <div>“so then let us not sleep as (the) rest also, but let us watch and be sober.”</div>
                                <div style="color: #f3ac3c; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: bold; opacity: 0.8; margin-top: 10px; font-family: inherit;">
                                    (1 Thessalonians 5:6)
                                </div>
                            </div>
                                            </div>
                </a>

                <!-- Background Icon Decoration -->
                <div class="verse-bg-icon"
                    style="position: absolute; bottom: 0px; left: -15px; font-size: 8rem; opacity: 0.08; color: #f3ac3c; pointer-events: none; z-index: 1; transform: rotate(-10deg);">
                    📖</div>
            </div>

            <script>
                (function () {
                    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {
                        const widget = document.querySelector('.verse-card');
                        if (!widget) return;

                        const arabic = widget.querySelector('.verse-text-arabic');
                        const coptic = widget.querySelector('.verse-text-coptic');
                        const english = widget.querySelector('.verse-text-english');

                        const slides = [arabic, coptic, english].filter(Boolean);
                        if (slides.length <= 1) return;

                        let currentIndex = 0;
                        setInterval(() => {
                            slides[currentIndex].style.opacity = '0';
                            slides[currentIndex].style.visibility = 'hidden';

                            currentIndex = (currentIndex + 1) % slides.length;

                            slides[currentIndex].style.opacity = '1';
                            slides[currentIndex].style.visibility = 'visible';
                        }, 5000);
                    });
                })();
            </script>
        </div>
        <style>
            .verse-card:hover {
                transform: translateY(-5px) scale(1.02) !important;
                border-color: #f3ac3c !important;
                box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5) !important;
            }

            body.mode-dark .verse-card {
                background: #1e1e1e !important;
                border-color: rgba(243, 172, 60, 0.2) !important;
            }

            body.mode-pascha .verse-card {
                background: #040404 !important;
                border-color: rgba(243, 172, 60, 0.2) !important;
            }

            body.mode-dark .verse-bg-icon,
            body.mode-pascha .verse-bg-icon {
                opacity: 0.02 !important;
            }
        </style>
        </p>
